  "summary": "Sudo Code (scode) is a Rust CLI coding agent speaking ACP over stdio and WebSocket, with three auth modes, JSONL session persistence, per-session system-prompt/memory controls, and a stated inline-only, model-agnostic, local-first design. The nexus-VFS mailbox integration and FsBackend deployment modes are described as design/architecture in README docs. Evidence coverage: 133 of 300 packet slices were shown to the model; the rest were withheld by the prompt budget.",
  "superseded_claim_ids": []
